# Build output. The build tree is ~10 GB (rootfs, disk images, QEMU logs,
# rendered screenshots) and none of it belongs in the repository: every byte of
# it is reproduced by ./build.sh from the sources and config/ that ARE tracked.
build/

# Generated Wayland bindings. protocol/*.xml is the source of truth; these are
# produced by wayland-scanner during the build, and the exact bytes depend on
# the scanner version (see protocol/README.md - that matters here).
protocol/*-protocol.c
protocol/*-protocol.h
protocol/*-client-header.h
pg/

# Editor and OS noise.
*.o
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store

# Local scratch
/tmp/
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc